    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Generated from the FR-02 YAML requests in postman/collections/PDM A2 API Testing. Use only an isolated DEV/TEST database. FR-01 requires an empty database; run FR-01 before FR-02 when running both. Preserve request order. Regenerate this JSON after changing its YAML source."
